<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Oct industry output up 3.8 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Hungary Oct industry output up 3.8 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's industrial output rose a seasonally-adjusted 3.8 percent in October compared with September, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The year-on-year rise in October was 5.8 percent, KSH said.  </p>
<p>		    Jan-Oct'96 Jan-Sept'96  Oct'96  Sept'96 Oct'95</p>
<p> Monthly change     n.a.	 n.a.	+3.8    +4.9    +0.5</p>
<p>Year-on-year</p>
<p>   change (pct)    +2.0	 +1.5	 +5.8    +2.5    +4.3</p>
<p>NOTE - The KSH said it had recalculated its industrial output figures for 1996 and 1995 on the basis of new data received from the econom  </p>
